          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Pucca has one great dream in her life, to kiss her sweet and tender Garu, the little Ninja, who does not have the slightest desire in the world to do so!\nBy using the Wiimote, you embark on small adventures to overcome obstacles to kiss Garu, your true love!",
